1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,060
Pat your head.

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,220
Rub your tummy.

3
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,139
Now... SWAP!

4
00:00:04,139 --> 00:00:05,267
Tangled, right?

5
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,705
Your brain mails every order...

6
00:00:07,705 --> 00:00:09,233
to BOTH hands.

7
00:00:09,273 --> 00:00:11,350
Go back. Slowly.

8
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,640
Feel your tummy hand?

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,333
It got the PAT order too.

10
00:00:14,359 --> 00:00:16,680
So your brain shreds the copy...

11
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,933
on every single pat.

12
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,433
That's the strain you feel.

13
00:00:20,474 --> 00:00:22,000
A tiny shredder...

14
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,333
working overtime.

15
00:00:23,394 --> 00:00:24,300
Little kids' shredders

16
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,560
are still growing:

17
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,700
squeeze one hand...

18
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,807
the other often squeezes too.

19
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:30,967
Till about age TEN.

20
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,300
Now try it...

21
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,510
FASTER.

